Pizzapants was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the new Support ability, which would trigger whenever another ally monster attacked. In its case, a 1/1 copy of the attacking monster would be added to your hand. It had stats of 5/5 for 7G.
[[File:Pizzapants (Beta 44.1).png|thumb|226x226px|Beta 44.1]]
'''Beta 44.0''' reworked it entirely. It's now a 2/3 for 4G monster (thus gainging -3/-2 and -3G) with Haste and a Magic effect that would give it +1/+1 for each Pizzapants you have summoned before. So the first one gains nothing, the second +1/+1, the third +2/+2 and so on. '''Beta 44.1''' increased its cost to 5G, while '''Beta 49.0''' made its effect an Aura, thus it can gain the buffs from summoning effects as well. '''Beta 54.1''' gave it +3 HP, but its Aura no longer gives HP, and only counts those you played. '''Beta 57.1''' reverted this change, bringing it back to its 2 ATK and 3 HP which gains +1/+1 version.
[[File:Pizzapants (Beta 49.0).png|thumb|226x226px|Beta 49.0]]

